---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import firesmoke from '../images/firesmoke.webp';
import skowint from '../images/skowint.webp';
import boots from '../images/boots.webp';
import nordsnow from '../images/nordsnow.webp';
---

<Layout title="The Story - Rewild" description="The story of Rewild, and the philosophy behind it.">

  <!-- Navigation -->
  <Nav />

  <!-- Story -->
  <section class="bg-white pt-36 pb-24 md:pt-44 md:pb-36">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12">
      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-24">
        <div class="md:order-1 md:sticky md:top-32 self-start">
          <Image
            src={firesmoke}
            alt="Fire smoke"
            width={900}
            densities={[1, 2]}
            class="w-full h-auto aspect-[4/5] object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="md:order-2">
          <h1 class="font-display font-medium text-3xl md:text-4xl text-forest mb-10 leading-tight">
            The story of Rewild
          </h1>
          <div class="space-y-6 text-forest font-light leading-relaxed text-[1.08rem]">
            <p>
              Some of you might relate:
            </p>
            <p>
              At one point in life, the intensity of challenges led to injury and burn out.
            </p>
            <p>
              I found myself in a place that I no longer had the capacity for.
            </p>
            <p>
              My chest was in constant physical pain from accumulated stress and emotions.
            </p>
            <p>
              I felt trapped and isolated.
            </p>
            <p>
              Seeing no apparent solution to my life situation.
            </p>
            <p>
              My instincts were telling me to get out.
            </p>
            <p>
              To move it out of my system.
            </p>
            <p>
              Straight from work, I began to run up local mountains.
            </p>
            <p>
              As if to grasp for air while suffocating.
            </p>
            <p>
              In all weather, every season.
            </p>
            <p>
              Sun, wind, frost, rain or snow.
            </p>
            <Image
              src={nordsnow}
              alt="Snowy mountain trail"
              width={900}
              densities={[1, 2]}
              class="md:hidden w-full h-auto aspect-[3/2] object-cover object-center"
              loading="lazy"
            />
            <p>
              I welcomed the elements as a gateway into presence.
            </p>
            <p>
              Alone and far from anyone.
            </p>
            <p>
              Sometimes hiking up in deep snow.
            </p>
            <p>
              It was not easy.
            </p>
            <p>
              My lungs working hard to keep me moving.
            </p>
            <p>
              With each breath, tensions releasing.
            </p>
            <p>
              Every part of my body coming online.
            </p>
            <p>
              Every cell filling with life.
            </p>
            <p>
              Immersing in nature with all of my senses.
            </p>
            <p>
              Nostrils sticking from the cold air.
            </p>
            <p>
              Picking up the citrusy scent of spruce needles.
            </p>
            <p>
              Reminding me of life all around.
            </p>
            <p>
              The soft hiss of snow crystals flowing from trees.
            </p>
            <p>
              Onto the ground covered in glitter.
            </p>
            <Image
              src={skowint}
              alt="Footprints in deep snow on a mountain ridge at sunset"
              width={900}
              densities={[1, 2]}
              class="md:hidden w-full h-auto aspect-[3/2] object-cover object-center"
              loading="lazy"
            />
            <p>
              I felt overwhelmed by gratitude.
            </p>
            <p>
              For witnessing this spectacle.
            </p>
            <p>
              For feeling at home here.
            </p>
            <p>
              And inside of myself.
            </p>
            <p>
              Where spaces inhabited by stress were cleared.
            </p>
            <p>
              Then re-filled with pure life.
            </p>
            <p>
              Again and again, and again...
            </p>
            <p>
              Even though physically challenging, the trips became addictive.
            </p>
            <p>
              Resistance to doing this seemingly hard thing disappeared.
            </p>
            <p>
              Leaving me with joy, peace and deep appreciation of being alive.
            </p>
            <p>
              In awe of the incredible beauty of nature.
            </p>
            <Image
              src={boots}
              alt="Boots resting in the snow at sunset"
              width={700}
              densities={[1, 2]}
              class="md:hidden w-full h-auto aspect-[2/3] object-cover object-center"
              loading="lazy"
            />
            <p>
              The effects lingered.
            </p>
            <p>
              My capacity to deal with stress in daily life expanded.
            </p>
            <p>
              My perspective shifted.
            </p>
            <p>
              Resilience increased.
            </p>
            <p>
              My body felt strong and capable.
            </p>
            <p>
              Suddenly my life began to change.
            </p>
            <p>
              I was able to buy a house.
            </p>
            <p>
              I started to pursue a path aligned with my inner compass.
            </p>
            <p>
              I found myself in a loving relationship that I forgot I always wanted.
            </p>
            <p>
              Stress was no longer my baseline.
            </p>
            <p>
              Survival mode gave way to creativity and a sense of freedom.
            </p>
            <p>
              It remains to this day.
            </p>
            <p>
              The transformation wildly inspired me to share these tools with others.
            </p>
            <p>
              So they can feel the same relief and strength in their own lives.
            </p>
            <p>
              The trips turned out to be the very first, organic form of the <a href="/evening-reset" class="font-semibold underline decoration-forest/40 hover:decoration-forest transition-colors duration-200">Evening Reset</a>.
            </p>
            <p>
              Now more refined, accessible, and constantly evolving.
            </p>
            <p>
              With you.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <Footer />

</Layout>
